# Graph Sync Agent Instructions

This generated project intentionally does not carry reusable graph-sync agent
specs locally.

## Required Skill Kit

Use the installed skills from [wordlift/graph-sync-agent-kit](https://github.com/wordlift/graph-sync-agent-kit)
for graph-sync agent workflows.

If the skills are not installed, install the Graph Sync Agent Kit plugin from the
WordLift agent marketplace or install the skills from:

```text
git@github.com:wordlift/graph-sync-agent-kit.git
```

## Local Scope

Project-specific agent notes are allowed here when they describe this
repository's domain, client, configuration, validation commands, or operational
constraints.

## Maintainer Macros

- `deploy release [major|minor|patch]` (default: `patch`)
  - Script: `scripts/deploy_release.sh [major|minor|patch]`
  - Steps:
    - bump release version
    - refresh dependencies and lockfile (`uv sync --dev`, `uv lock`)
    - update project docs as needed
    - commit all changes, create tag, push branch and tags

- `upgrade project`
  - Script: `scripts/upgrade_project.sh`
  - Steps:
    - update to latest `wordlift-sdk` in `pyproject.toml` and lockfile
    - update `worai` to the latest version in GH workflow
    - run `deploy release patch` macro
